{"id":2741,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>为深入贯彻落实团中央关于大学生志愿服务西部计划的工作部署，引导青年学子投身西部建设。3月31日，我院在15101H教室举行西部计划专题宣讲会，全体研究生到场参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMlVoRnmnVMm9DouRf7UzUDLz-ZLRfU2LNWkMR-YU4-ioRl0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4LYh2n1hfUzNanlM7LmUZo7CaMmV7olrfnRUZoRLPU8QFUlCsL4NZMlQFLlV7L4vJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMzlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6655&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/333FFAA90ECD2488F061D9EAD48831CF/AF73985F/1AD37\" vheight=\" 394.687px\" vwidth=\" 526px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMlVoRnmnVMm9DouRf7UzUDLz-ZLRfU2LNWkMR-YU4-ioRl0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4LYh2n1hfUzNanlM7LmUZo7CaMmV7olrfnRUZoRLPU8QFUlCsL4NZMlQFLlV7L4vJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMzlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6655&e=.jpg\"></p><p>宣讲会上，主持人围绕西部计划项目背景、招募条件、服务岗位、保障政策及发展前景等方面进行全面细致讲解，系统介绍服务领域、报名流程与考核要求，结合典型案例生动阐释项目价值。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MM7lobU8VVL4vsnuzAkMRTfL8WkLmTUVM7UiolM7UNL8UN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiL1ybnShVMzn2LzGbMlCsozNPn7LiUNU8M8C4nmWRnRfFL87bo7M2MlMFLmQkMNLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMzlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6655&e=.jpg\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3529EE54F1095F7991DC5BD47F3F2CD0/3A98CF5C/26B6C\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 525px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MM7lobU8VVL4vsnuzAkMRTfL8WkLmTUVM7UiolM7UNL8UN70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiL1ybnShVMzn2LzGbMlCsozNPn7LiUNU8M8C4nmWRnRfFL87bo7M2MlMFLmQkMNLJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMzlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6655&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次宣讲会的开展，通过详实解读与重点说明，让同学们厘清了西部计划的相关政策与核心内涵，为自身未来就业与长远发展筑牢根基，进一步拓宽了我院研究生的就业选择空间。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=MMlVoRnmnVMm9DouRf7UzUDLz-ZLRfU2LNWkMR-YU4-ioRl0gihFp2hmCIa0LYy4LYh2n1hfUzNanlM7LmUZo7CaMmV7olrfnRUZoRLPU8QFUlCsL4NZMlQFLlV7L4vJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4CDMzlJqdnnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=6655&e=.jpg"}